  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) #12343, eff 8-14-17; (formerly Env-Hw 103.45, renumbered by #12920) (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100); ss by #14278, eff 8-1-25",
