  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 103.47 EPA identification number",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 103.47 “EPA identification number” means the site-specific number assigned by the department upon receipt of a complete Form HWM-2, “RCRA C Site Identification Form” dated August 2025, submitted by a:\n\n(a) Generator;\n\n(b) Recognized trader;\n\n(c) Transporter;\n\n(d) Transfer facility;\n\n(e) Treatment, storage, or disposal facility;\n\n(f) Universal waste handler;\n\n(g) Healthcare facility operating under Env-Hw 1300;\n\n(h) Reverse distributor; or\n\n(i) Used oil handler.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) #12343, eff 8-14-17; (formerly Env-Hw 103.45, renumbered by #12920) (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100); ss by #14278, eff 8-1-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw100.html"
